sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Handler as HTTP Handler
    participant Service as Service Layer
    participant DB as Database Layer

    Client->>Handler: Request
    Handler->>Service: Call service method

    alt Success
        Service->>DB: Query database
        DB-->>Service: Return data
        Service-->>Handler: Return result
        Handler-->>Client: 200 OK + JSON
    else Error
        Service->>DB: Query database
        DB-->>Service: Return error
        Service->>Service: Wrap error with context
        Service-->>Handler: Return wrapped error
        Handler->>Handler: Check error type
        Handler->>Handler: Map to HTTP status
        Handler-->>Client: Error status + JSON
    end
